[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6060.95, "timestamp": "01:41:00", "text": "游戏。我个人花钱买了Kaki"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6064.95, "timestamp": "01:41:04", "text": "因为里面有《东京喰种》。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6067.75, "timestamp": "01:41:07", "text": "呃，他们正在添加，他们正在添加……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6069.91, "timestamp": "01:41:09", "text": "《玩具熊的五夜后宫》也是如此。哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6072.07, "timestamp": "01:41:12", "text": "很快。呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6073.51, "timestamp": "01:41:13", "text": "是的。是的，就像下一个补丁一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6074.95, "timestamp": "01:41:14", "text": "所以，下一个补丁就像《玩具熊的五夜后宫》一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6078.149, "timestamp": "01:41:18", "text": "弗雷迪的。等等，他们要加入肯。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6080.47, "timestamp": "01:41:20", "text": "等等，什么？他们补充说，所以，他们补充说"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6083.189, "timestamp": "01:41:23", "text": "基。所以，我们有Ki，这就是它所在的地方。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6085.35, "timestamp": "01:41:25", "text": "可能"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6087.83, "timestamp": "01:41:27", "text": "然后他们又补充道：它在那里吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6090.55, "timestamp": "01:41:30", "text": "他们现在在玩什么游戏？它在哪里？是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6092.47, "timestamp": "01:41:32", "text": "它在这里。是的。所以，你将无法"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6094.47, "timestamp": "01:41:34", "text": "去看，但最好的方法是去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6096.47, "timestamp": "01:41:36", "text": "店铺。所以，在最底部，你可以看到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6097.99, "timestamp": "01:41:37", "text": "那个看起来很奇怪的包，里面好像装着所有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6099.669, "timestamp": "01:41:39", "text": "从中取出一些零零碎碎的东西。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6103.189, "timestamp": "01:41:43", "text": "店铺。去商店看看，然后你就会看到杀手。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6104.87, "timestamp": "01:41:44", "text": "顶部。塔兹，还有所有的一切"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6107.43, "timestamp": "01:41:47", "text": "游戏中的杀手。哇。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6111.669, "timestamp": "01:41:51", "text": "那挺好的。我的天啊。而且，如果你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6113.43, "timestamp": "01:41:53", "text": "点击他，你就会看到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6115.91, "timestamp": "01:41:55", "text": "定制化作为一种​​子类型。你可以"}]